"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "普瓦（Phuvah）",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "普瓦Phuvah",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>普瓦（Phuvah）</h1><p>某英文譯本將普瓦（Puvah）拼寫成Phuvah。普瓦是族長以薩迦的一個兒子（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01046013\" data-end-ref=\"01046013\">創46:13</data>）。</p><p><em>見</em> <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"7040\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">普瓦</data>。</p>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "01046013",
"start_ref_usfm": "GEN 46:13",
"end_ref": "01046013",
"end_ref_usfm": "GEN 46:13"
}
],
